    "baseline": "FR-34, FR-42, FR-43, FR-44; SRS (3).docx.\nThi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF x\u1EED l\u00FD chi ti\u1EBFt (1).docx: UC2.3-U16 LopHocService.HuyAsync (b\u1EA3ng 125); UC3.3-U16 BaiTapService.LayAsync (b\u1EA3ng 175); UC4.1-U17 TienDoService.LayAsync (b\u1EA3ng 268); UC5.1-U15 TinNhanService.TheoLopAsync (b\u1EA3ng 301); TV-U05 LopHocController.ChiTiet (b\u1EA3ng 389); TV-U10 LopHocService.ChiTietAsync (b\u1EA3ng 394); TV-U11 LopHocService.LichAsync (b\u1EA3ng 395); TV-U12 LopHocService.LocBuoiAsync (b\u1EA3ng 396); TV-U13 LopHocService.BuoiAsync (b\u1EA3ng 397); TV-U22 LopHocService.DanhGiaDaGuiAsync (b\u1EA3ng 406)\nNh\u00E1nh/kh\u1EDBp n\u1ED1i: Ti\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9 v\u00E0 li\u00EAn k\u1EBFt ngu\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i t\u1ED5ng quan l\u1EDBp",
    "strategy": "Bottom-up, BU3; th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 ch\u1EA1y #133.\nKi\u1EC3m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc: IT-111, IT-157\nGh\u00E9p sau: HTTP \u2192 binding/validation/auth/antiforgery/filter \u2192 BaiTapService, LopHocService, TienDoService, TinNhanService, LopHocController \u2192 EF/SQL Server\nC\u0103n c\u1EE9: Sau Service\u2013DB v\u00E0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp li\u00EAn quan, gh\u00E9p HTTP/MVC \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m binding, cookie, antiforgery v\u00E0 chuy\u1EC3n k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 th\u00E0nh response. Kh\u00F4ng t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u \u0111\u00E3 sinh \u1EDF TC ti\u00EAn quy\u1EBFt; m\u1ED7i TC/DL fixture \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp.",
    "conditions": "Fixture F8 \u002B F0; to\u00E0n b\u1ED9 DL d\u00F9ng fixture ri\u00EAng.\nH1/G1, F8, tuNgay/denNgay h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7; c\u00E1c kh\u00F3a b\u00E0i/bu\u1ED5i \u0111\u00E3 bi\u1EBFt.\nHuy=CancellationToken ri\u00EAng khi method c\u00F3 tham s\u1ED1. RV/stamp/Id l\u1EA5y t\u1EEB fixture th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng hard-code gi\u00E1 tr\u1ECB gi\u1EA3.",
    "steps": "1. Ch\u1EA1y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc IT-111, IT-157; t\u1EA1o fixture F8 m\u1EDBi v\u00E0 host test tr\u1ECF DB n\u00E0y; ch\u1EC9 t\u1EAFt hai worker khi ca kh\u00F4ng ki\u1EC3m worker.\n2. D\u00F9ng WebApplicationFactory/host th\u1EADt v\u00E0 HttpClient HTTPS ri\u00EAng,AllowAutoRedirect=false. Actor/cookie theo TC; n\u1EBFu c\u00F3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp ph\u1EA3i qua Identity/cookie th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng fake authentication handler.\n3. GET form t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng c\u00F9ng client l\u1EA5y cookie CSRF v\u00E0 __RequestVerificationToken. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1ED1 \u00FD b\u1ECF token \u1EDF DL CSRF. Input: H1/G1, F8, tuNgay/denNgay h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7; c\u00E1c kh\u00F3a b\u00E0i/bu\u1ED5i \u0111\u00E3 bi\u1EBFt.\n4. GET t\u1ED5ng quan, m\u1EDF t\u1EEBng b\u00E0i/bu\u1ED5i t\u1EEB k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3; so s\u1ED1 li\u1EC7u v\u1EDBi Service/SQL. \u0110i\u1EC3m v\u00E0o: GET /HocTap/LopHoc/ChiTiet?id=C1\u0026tab=overview. Nghi\u1EC7p v\u1EE5 d\u00F9ng AJAX; auth form gi\u1EEF form th\u01B0\u1EDDng; multipart \u0111\u00FAng t\u00EAn field khi c\u00F3 file.\n5. Ghi raw status,Content-Type,Location/body tr\u01B0\u1EDBc redirect r\u1ED3i assert contract: 200; s\u1ED1 li\u1EC7u 1/1/1 bu\u1ED5i, 3/3/2 b\u00E0i v\u00E0 TB=7.00; li\u00EAn k\u1EBFt tr\u1ECF \u0111\u00FAng ngu\u1ED3n C1.\n6. \u0110\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng context/connection \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp; Oracle: SELECT * FROM dbo.DanhGiaDoiTac WHERE LopHocId=@C1; SELECT * FROM dbo.LichSuDanhGiaDoiTac WHERE DanhGiaId=@D1; SELECT * FROM dbo.PhieuDanhGia WHERE LopHocId=@C1; \u0110\u1ED1i chi\u1EBFu ri\u00EAng latest submission b\u1EB1ng ORDER BY NopLuc DESC,Id DESC v\u00E0 join \u0111\u00FAng BaiTapGiao/BuoiHoc/LichHoc; kh\u00F4ng l\u1EA5y t\u1ED5ng t\u1EEB model \u0111ang tracking.\n7. Assert d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u li\u00EAn th\u00F4ng v\u00E0 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u kh\u00F4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED5i: Kh\u00F4ng l\u1EABn d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u C2 ho\u1EB7c t\u0103ng s\u1ED1 b\u00E0i khi join nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EA7n n\u1ED9p; kh\u00F4ng ghi \u0111i\u1EC3m t\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p gi\u1EA3.\n8. Ghi trace/request/test name v\u00E0 TRX,SQL tr\u01B0\u1EDBc\u2013sau,file hash. D\u1EEBng host/worker,\u0111\u1EE3i k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc scope r\u1ED3i reset fixture/sandbox; kh\u00F4ng ch\u00E9p k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 Pass t\u1EEB b\u1ED9 kh\u00E1c.",
    "expected": "1. Ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i / h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng: 200; s\u1ED1 li\u1EC7u 1/1/1 bu\u1ED5i, 3/3/2 b\u00E0i v\u00E0 TB=7.00; li\u00EAn k\u1EBFt tr\u1ECF \u0111\u00FAng ngu\u1ED3n C1.\n2. D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u00E0 side effect: Kh\u00F4ng l\u1EABn d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u C2 ho\u1EB7c t\u0103ng s\u1ED1 b\u00E0i khi join nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EA7n n\u1ED9p; kh\u00F4ng ghi \u0111i\u1EC3m t\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p gi\u1EA3."
